      <description>&lt;section class=&#34;project-resources&#34; aria-labelledby=&#34;project-resources-title&#34;&gt;
  &lt;h2 id=&#34;project-resources-title&#34;&gt;프로젝트 자료&lt;/h2&gt;
  &lt;p class=&#34;project-resources__lead&#34;&gt;현재 공개 저장소와 v9.0 검증 결과를 직접 확인할 수 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;ul class=&#34;project-resources__links&#34;&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
      &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/HeungJAELEE/HeungTology&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;
        &lt;span class=&#34;project-resources__label&#34;&gt;GitHub 저장소&lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;span class=&#34;project-resources__url&#34;&gt;github.com/HeungJAELEE/HeungTology&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
      &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/HeungJAELEE/HeungTology/blob/main/ontology/releases/9.0.0/validation-report.json&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;
